@startuml
title UC-011 Back up and restore the changes of a course
start
:A course is backed up;
if (Include the navigation changes?) then (yes)
  :The changes of the course and of each activity go in the backup;
else (no)
endif
:The backup is restored;
if (Restore the navigation changes?) then (yes)
  :Read the keys the context already sets;
  :Keep the changes the context does not set;
  :Point the conditions to what was restored;
  :Save all the changes at once;
else (no)
endif
stop
@enduml
